# Polestar Experimental, Mount Hyjal part 2 of 3, for both factions (2026-11-12). Hand-written.
# Sources as in part 1: Forever's quest data for quests, givers, enders and objectives; the one recorded session
# (an Alliance player, levels 57 to 60) for the order, the spots and the chain links the data lacks. The Horde's
# Elderwild quests are not recorded: those steps follow the quest data alone.
# Order: the Curious Crow, Malorne's Retreat (Alliance), Barkskin Burrow (Brerufa's Den Guardians, then Osi's
# berries, then the elders) with the Deadwood camps around it, Elderwild (the Alliance and Horde outposts stand
# side by side) with Mourning's Rest and the overlook west of it, then east into the Cradle of Tranquility: the
# wild gods' errands, Johun's camp (Alliance) and back west to Marrosis and Shalla'kal.
# Quest log: a character arrives with about 28 quests carried from the 50-60 guides, and the game's log holds 40.
# The veteran's Anywhere But Here is taken after Mourning's Rest, on the way west to the overlook, and the
# breadcrumbs for part 3 (A Clever Creature, Trail Assist) wait for part 3's way through the Cradle.
# Offered only after another quest is handed in (the recording; one player, so leads to confirm): Heading Up the
# Mountain after The Capricious Corvid; Fenwick's quests one at a time; Of Friend and Fur after Balance Through
# Strength (Brerufa's window held nothing else before that hand-in, which also lifted Barkskin standing from
# Hostile to Unfriendly); Sweetpaw Jam after Of Friend and Fur; Meet the Elders after Sweetpaw Jam; Deal Dread to
# Deadwood after Meet the Elders (Barkbound Blessings and Windswept Wards were first offered then too, so they are
# taken there); More Work? and To the Summit of Eternity after Sefira's three quests;
# More of the Same, then Belle's Ring, then the second Belle's Ring after More Work?; Battle Recall after Anywhere
# But Here; Jereman's three errands after Heading Up the Mountain; Fox Hole after Area Denial Skunks; Resupply after
# Fox Hole; Stolen Life and Bone Sweet Bone after The Balance of Life and Death; Prey and Predator after Violent
# Venison; Trail Assist after Sacred Refreshment.
# Balance Through Strength came to the recorded player as a party share: that Brerufa offers it at Hostile
# standing is not recorded yet.
# Left out on purpose:
# - Barkskin Beginnings (94504): it asks for Neutral with Barkskin Burrow, which this route doesn't reach.
# - Beads for Brerufa (93925): a repeatable hand-in for reputation.
# - Wake Memories (93510) and Lifted by Legacy (92101), after Battle Recall: they send you to Redridge and to
#   Thousand Needles, and the veteran's last errands (Praise 93551, Ends Meet 93567, Soldier's Solace 96558 with
#   an elite spirit, Last Wishes 96561) come back to Mount Hyjal.
# - Ewe Wandered Off (96674): six sheep led back to Mirt one at a time, for little experience (the recorded
#   player dropped it once and took six minutes over it later).
# - The Horde's Head Scratcher (92446, an elite), Flags of Our Forebears (91794, done in Dae'gun and handed in
#   here), Herbs for the Bruised and Weary (96616, no recorded or known place for the herbs), and the crafting
#   deliveries (90854, 92433, 95769, 97119).
# - Open Season (91696) and Barkskin Breakout (91698): not recorded, and the data has no hand-in for the first.
# - The Horde's Sawyer errands (97001, 97006, 97007): the data has no giver or hand-in for them.

step Back to Mount Hyjal
  when !zone "Mount Hyjal"
  tip Experimental route (alpha). It is written from Forever's quest data and the first recording of the zone, and some steps are not checked in game yet: if a step is wrong, tell us on Polestar's Discord or GitHub and name the step.
  tip This part carries on from part 1: fly to the Tainted Foothills, or ride in from Everlook through Darkwhisper Gorge.
  fly "Tainted Foothills"
  zone Mount Hyjal

step The Curious Crow
  when onquest 96930
  tip Experimental route (alpha): if a step is wrong, tell us on Polestar's Discord or GitHub and name the step.
  tip West across the foothills, past the ancients' outpost, to the Curious Crow at the southern end of Felblood Scar.
  turnin 96930                          -- Curious Crow
  accept 96931                          -- Heading Up the Mountain: for the Cradle of Tranquility, later in this guide

step Malorne's Retreat
  only Alliance
  tip West along the southern slopes to Malorne's Retreat: Fenwick Togglespring, a gnome test pilot, hangs tangled up in a tree. A sturdy branch lies just south of him.
  accept 92702                          -- Branch Out
  collect 274617 quest 92702.1 @24.9,77.5  -- Sturdy Tree Branch
  turnin 92702
  accept 92064                          -- Tree Free
  kill 254501 quest 92064.1             -- Tree Branch, above Fenwick's head
  turnin 92064
  accept 96559                          -- Supply Drop

step Fenwick's survival pack
  only Alliance
  tip His pack fell just north of the tree. Open it, then wait half a minute while its safety lock discharges before you open it again.
  turnin 96559                          -- Personal Survival Pack
  accept 93383                          -- Contents Under Pressure
  turnin 93383

step Brerufa
  tip North-west to Barkskin Burrow, the furbolgs' den in the hillside: Brerufa waits just north of its mouth. The Barkskin furbolgs show as hostile until your standing with them improves, but none of them attacked in the recording: the Deadwood furbolgs in the camps around are the ones to fight. Brerufa offers more only once this first quest is handed in.
  accept 93952                          -- Balance Through Strength

step Deadwood Den Guardians
  tip The Deadwood furbolgs camp on the slopes north and east of Brerufa: kill their Den Guardians.
  loop
  goto 23.0,69.5
  goto 22.3,66.0
  goto 23.8,64.0
  goto 25.8,74.0
  kill 252063 x9 quest 93952.1          -- Deadwood Den Guardian

step Brerufa
  turnin 93952
  accept 92111                          -- Of Friend and Fur

step Osi Mistpaw
  tip Inside the burrow: Osi Mistpaw at the far end.
  turnin 92111
  accept 93831                          -- Sweetpaw Jam

step Bear berries
  tip The bear berries grow on the slopes around the burrow: a few on the hill north of Brerufa, most of them east of the burrow.
  loop
  goto 19.4,66.5
  goto 20.3,71.2
  goto 23.5,75.5
  goto 27.5,77.0
  goto 31.0,78.9
  goto 33.4,76.7
  goto 24.8,77.5
  collect 262818 x30 quest 93831.1      -- Bear Berries

step Barkskin Burrow
  tip Back to Osi, then the two elders at the back of the burrow. Suma Mossmane stands beside Osi, Thobon Sapclaw a little north-west of them, where the recording met him. Suma's moss grows around Elderwild, later in this guide; Thobon's amulets come from the harpies at the Shrine of Aviana (part 3), and you bring both back here then.
  turnin 93831                          -- Osi Mistpaw
  accept 91697                          -- Meet the Elders
  talk 256650                           -- Elder Pinespeaker
  talk 256627                           -- Elder Mistpaw
  turnin 91697                          -- Elder Mistpaw
  accept 93826                          -- Deal Dread to Deadwood: on your way back here in part 3; keep it
  accept 93825                          -- Suma Mossmane: Barkbound Blessings
  accept 93827 @20.6,78.8               -- Thobon Sapclaw: Windswept Wards

step The Western Post
  when onquest 91881
  only Alliance
  tip North up the valley to Elderwild, where the Alliance outpost (Sefira Everbright, Hnaz Blunderflame) and the Horde's (Zet'gan, Ortak Lomgok) stand next to each other.
  turnin 91881                          -- Sefira Everbright

step The Western Post
  when onquest 94782
  only Horde
  tip North up the valley to Elderwild, where the Horde outpost (Zet'gan, Ortak Lomgok) and the Alliance's stand next to each other. The Horde hand-ins and quests here are not in our recordings yet.
  turnin 94782                          -- Zet'gan

step Ortak Lomgok
  when onquest 96830
  only Horde
  turnin 96830

step Elderwild
  tip The two outposts of Elderwild.
  accept 92591 only Alliance            -- Sefira Everbright: Final Death
  accept 92449 only Alliance            -- Blight No More
  accept 95027 only Alliance            -- Hnaz Blunderflame: Feathers in Flight
  accept 92592 only Horde               -- Zet'gan: Final Death
  accept 95026 only Horde               -- Blight No More
  accept 92609 only Horde               -- Feathers in Flight

step Moonveil Moss
  tip The moss for Suma grows around Elderwild: by the outposts and on the slopes north of them.
  loop
  goto 16.0,51.9
  goto 14.4,46.4
  goto 13.3,54.8
  collect 262802 x12 quest 93825.1      -- Moonveil Moss

step Eluneth
  tip South-east to Eluneth on the slope above Mourning's Rest.
  accept 90865                          -- Eluneth: Eyes of the Watchers

step Owl feathers
  tip The Hyjal Owls roost on the slopes between Eluneth and Barkskin Burrow: their feathers are for Elderwild.
  collect 253341 x9 quest 95027.1 only Alliance  -- Hyjal Owl Feather
  collect 253341 x9 quest 92609.1 only Horde

step Unmarked Grave
  only Alliance
  tip At the northern end of Mourning's Rest: something has dug up the grave. The Fleshflay Raveners around it carry what was taken.
  accept 90702                          -- Disturbed Grave

step Mourning's Rest
  tip The Scourge hold the ruins of Mourning's Rest, east of Elderwild: Fleshflay Raveners and Forgotten Soldiers everywhere, Eternal Sentries among them. Burn the bone pile at the south-eastern end with the Survivor's Torch: the Scourge Reanimator that answers carries the amulet.
  kill 249247 x3 quest 92449.1 only Alliance  -- Forgotten Soldier
  kill 249228 x12 quest 92449.2 only Alliance  -- Fleshflay Ravener
  kill 249247 x3 quest 95026.1 only Horde
  kill 249228 x12 quest 95026.2 only Horde
  collect 273322 x8 quest 90865.1       -- Watcher's Eye
  collect 273642 quest 90702.1 only Alliance  -- Ring of the Fallen Soldier
  collect 268573 quest 92591.1 only Alliance @28.0,57.7  -- Reanimator's Amulet
  collect 268573 quest 92592.1 only Horde @28.0,57.7

step Eluneth and the veteran
  tip Back to Eluneth, then the ghostly Veteran of the Third War at Mourning's Rest's western edge, where the recording met him, on your way west.
  turnin 90865
  accept 92100 @21.6,57.5               -- Veteran of the Third War: Anywhere But Here

step Elderwild
  only Alliance
  tip West to the Alliance outpost.
  turnin 92591                          -- Sefira Everbright
  turnin 92449
  turnin 90702
  turnin 95027                          -- Hnaz Blunderflame
  accept 90750                          -- Sefira Everbright: More Work?
  accept 91688                          -- To the Summit of Eternity: for Thisalee Crow, part 3; keep it

