step Elderwild
  only Horde
  tip West to the Horde outpost.
  turnin 92592                          -- Zet'gan
  turnin 95026
  turnin 92609
  accept 95248                          -- To the Summit of Eternity: for Thisalee Crow, part 3; keep it

step The overlook
  tip West to the overlook above the valley: the veteran's old scabbard lies there. Hand his quest in at the scabbard and take the next from it, then use the scabbard in your bags to call his spirit and listen to his story.
  turnin 92100                          -- Embroidered Scabbard
  accept 96550                          -- Battle Recall
  talk 255038                           -- Veteran of the Third War
  turnin 96550

step Shalla'kal and Galvinquam
  tip East past Mourning's Rest into the Cradle of Tranquility: Shalla'kal, the great cat, waits by the path, and Galvinquam Leafsyre rests in the ruins just south of her.
  accept 93615                          -- Shalla'kal: Kits and Cats
  accept 96979                          -- Galvinquam Leafsyre: Sacred Refreshment

step Lisbael Highfeather
  tip East across the Cradle to Lisbael Highfeather.
  accept 96145                          -- Past Wing and Claw: for Phoebe Highfeather, part 3; keep it

step Jereman
  when onquest 96931
  tip North to the old bridge over the Cradle: touch the crow effigy on it and Jereman, the crow wild god, appears.
  turnin 96931                          -- Jereman
  accept 96939                          -- The Balance of Life and Death
  accept 96978                          -- Violent Venison

step The falls and the first kitten
  tip Fill Galvinquam's gourd at the falls beside the bridge. Solstice, one of Shalla'kal's kittens, plays just west of the falls: walk up to her.
  complete 96979 @41.6,44.6             -- fill the gourd
  goto 38.5,47.3 "Solstice"

step Johun's camp
  only Alliance
  tip North to Johun "Punchy" Dillas and his crates. Drive the skunks out from behind the crates without attacking them.
  accept 92015                          -- Area Denial Skunks
  complete 92015 @43.4,36.6
  turnin 92015
  accept 92014                          -- Fox Hole

step Brie
  tip Brie, the second kitten, plays just west of Johun's camp.
  goto 41.4,36.4 "Brie"

step Foxes
  only Alliance
  tip The Rustleaf Foxes are thick in the woods around Johun's camp.
  collect 274586 x9 quest 92014.1 @42.5,35.0  -- Rustleaf Fox Tail

step Johun "Punchy" Dillas
  only Alliance
  turnin 92014
